e the violent of  the violence the fighting of course the  fact that they're not sure where all the  people who are really in need are  there's been so much turmoil and  bureaucratic obstacles especially in  Houthi territory we were told by a  senior aide coordinator the Houthis  won't give them enough visas to get  skilled people on the ground to help  Deana seeing little awesome is a  reminder that tens of thousands of  children have already died in Yemen  Elizabeth Palmer thank you so much for  bringing us this important story
 

